10 REM HELLO - PMD 85-2, IN LINES AND IN TEXT
20 GCLEAR
30 REM ---- FIRST THE "G" IN BASIC-G: SCALE FIXES A WINDOW, MOVE AND PLOT ----
40 REM ---- DRAW IN IT. THERE ARE NO GRAPHICS CHARACTERS TO PRINT INSTEAD. ----
50 SCALE -135,135,-128,128
60 FOR S=120 TO 20 STEP -20
70 MOVE -S,-S
80 PLOT S,-S
90 PLOT S,S
100 PLOT -S,S
110 PLOT -S,-S
120 NEXT S
130 BEEP
140 REM ---- PAUSE COUNTS IN TENTHS OF A SECOND, SO THIS BEAT IS TWO ----
150 PAUSE 20
160 GCLEAR
170 REM ---- THEN THE TEXT SCREEN, FILLED A LINE AT A TIME. INK(N) IS THE ----
180 REM ---- WHOLE COLOUR MODEL: 0 PLAIN, 1 BLINKING, 2 DIM, 3 BOTH. ----
190 FOR I=0 TO 24
200 C=I-4*INT(I/4)
210 T=I-14*INT(I/14)
220 PRINT INK(C);TAB(T);"HELLO FROM THE PMD 85!"
230 NEXT I
240 PRINT INK(1);TAB(17);"* BASICALLY *"
250 PAUSE 25
260 GOTO 20
